Just for future reference,

It's probably better to wish for some color Dragon Scale Mail rather
than any plate mail--not only lighter and has a better AC (9 rather
than 7), but it also gives a resistance. General consensus has it
either for a Gray Dragon Scale Mail (magic resistance) or Silver Dragon
Scale mail (reflection). I'm coming around to thinking gray dragon's
the better for the game before the castle, but a good cloak of MR and
silver scale mail can't be beat. And, even if you do get polymorphed
(you resist with gray), you'll turn into whatever kind of dragon's
scales you're wearing.

That's what people mean when they talk about gdsm (gray dragon scale
mail) or sdsm (silver dragon scale mail). "gdsm" could also be green
dragon, but no one ever wishes for green dragon scale mail ;-)

Also, remember to ask for a blessing and enchantment--+1 is pretty much
certain, but most folks ask for +2 and blessed.

Hence (real-world) shirts that say "I wished for a blessed +3 gdsm and
all I got was this lousy t-shirt".



